    "type": 0,
    "content": "**__Unidentified Gear__**\nAll endgame content has shifted to dropping unidentified gear instead of random items (my inventory thanks you), but this has lead to a change in how you should best process your hard earned loot into cold hard cash. The rarity of what you open when you crack unids is not affected by magic find, so the TP price is about equal to what the value of the gear is. That said, there's 2 ways about it: Open or Sell.",
