  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "This is a general salvage guide that applies to more than just unids\nWhen you open gear, you generally salvage it as follows: white/blue = basic/copper-fed, green = runecrafter's (so long as it has a rune/sigil attached, some fractal drops do not), yellow = mystic/silver-fed or sell if worth more than 1 ecto (only applies to Lv. 68+, otherwise almost always sell it, or salvage if the TP value is negligible [under-leveled rare gear is in a weird spot]), exo = MSK/BLSK/Sell depending on the price and the price of the rune/sigil affixed to it.) \nhttps://fast.farming-community.eu/salvaging/unid-gear",
