  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "**__Champion Bags and Boxes__**\nOpening champion bags on the level described by https://fast.farming-community.eu/bags/bag-opener for the greatest profits. Why is this? Because it scales the levels of gear and items you can get, which vary in value depending on level.",
