  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "**__Fractal Encryptions & Ascended Ring drops__**\nYou should always buy your deeply discounted keys. ALWAYS! even if you have to buy encryptions off the TP, it's still profitable. Free daily money sitting here, don't let it slip past!\nWhat about those pesky rings with garbage stats? Salvage them! But as per usual, there's a catch. It is high recommended that you attune your rings (maybe 25s cost) to double your salvage yield. As for buying the salvage kits, they're all about the same price (raid, fractal, wvw, pvp merchants), but get a 25 kit.",
